    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29603" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δυσ-φρόνη</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-φροσύνη</span>
			, in pl., <i>anxieties, troubles</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δυσφρονέων ἐπιλήθεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Th.</u>
					102
				</span></i>
			; in <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				2.52
			</span></i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραλύει δυσφρονᾶν</span> should
			be read (metri gr.) for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δυσφροσύναν
			παραλύει</span>, cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφρόνη,
			εὐφρόνη</span>.</div>
